  {"id":405,"question":"……..… is to engage patients and their families in a collaborative treatment process that teaches skills and provides support for fostering illness management","options":["A. Mission of rehabilitation","B. Vision of Rehabilitation","C. Goal of Rehabilitation","D. Aim of rehabilitation"],"answer":"C"},
