  {"id":417,"question":"The spinal nerves are distributed as follows","options":["A. 7 Cervical, 12 Thoracic, 5 Lumbar, 5 Sacral, 1 Coccygeal","B. 8 Cervical, 12 Thoracic, 5 Lumbar, 4 Sacral, 1 Coccygeal","C. 8 Cervical, 12 Thoracic, 5 Lumbar, 5 Sacral, 1 Coccygcal","D. 7 Cervical. 12 Thoracic. 4 Lumbar, 4 Sacral, 1 Coccygeal"],"answer":"C"},
