  {"id":450,"question":"Self-awareness is a key part of psychiatric nursing in that","options":["A. Relationship between the nurse and the patient can be personalized","B. It helps the nurse achieve authentic open and personal communicatíon","C. Gaps in communication can be bridged","D. Interdependent roles can be enhanced"],"answer":"B"},
