  {"id":467,"question":"Relying on the absence of menses while breast feeding as a method of contraception is highly effective under which of the following conditions?","options":["A. The baby is less than 8 month old","B. Exclusive breast feeding","C. Complimentary feeding","D. Supplementary feeding"],"answer":"B"},
