  {"id":471,"question":"The drops routinely put in the newborn eye to prevent eye infection due to gonorrhoea is","options":["A. Silver nitrate","B. Chloramphenicol eye drop","C. Genticin drops","D. Abidec drops"],"answer":"A"},
  {"id":472,"question":"Gender equity means","options":["A. Equal treatment of women and men in laws, policies, access to resources and services","B. Fairness and justice in the distribution of benefits and responsibilities between women and men","C. Law of nature that ensures women have less control over health care resources","D. Law of nature that ensures women have more control over health care resources"],"answer":"A"},
  {"id":473,"question":"The following statements regarding gender and HIV/AIDS among young people are true EXCEPT","options":["A. Risk of infection varies due to gender","B. Young women purchase condom as easily as young men","C. Young women see condoms as a sign of promiscuity","D. Young men use condoms more often than young women"],"answer":"B"},
