  {"id":476,"question":"The Following are primary objectives of integrated management of neonatal and childhood illnesses (IMNCD EXCEPT","options":["A. To reduce the frequency and severity of illness and disability","B. To contribute to and promote healthy growth and development of children","C. To heck for danger signs and ask questions about common conditions","D. To contribute to the reduction of morbidity and mortality among under-five"],"answer":"C"},
