  {"id":492,"question":"Which of the following statement best explain community mental health?","options":["A. Treatment of mentally ill within the community","B. Treatment of mentally ill within the PHC","C. Treatment of mentally ill outside the community","D. Treatment of mentally ill in the secondary health facility"],"answer":"A"},
  {"id":493,"question":"The scale of measurements that have magnitude, order, equal interval between classes but no absolute zero is","options":["A. Nominal","B. Ratio","C. Ordinal","D. Interval"],"answer":"D"},
